<section class="section section--flush page-hero"><div class="container prose"><h1>Cookie Policy</h1></div></section><section class="section section--tint"><div class="container prose"><h3>What we use</h3>
<p>This site sets no analytics, profiling or advertising cookies. It is a static site; nothing on it needs to remember you between visits.</p>
<h3>Cookies you may still receive</h3>
<p>Cloudflare may set a strictly necessary cookie (cf_clearance / __cf_bm) for security and bot mitigation. These are exempt from consent under Art. 5(3) of the ePrivacy Directive as strictly necessary for a service you requested.</p>
<h3>Third-party content</h3>
<p>Pages load web fonts from Google Fonts (fonts.googleapis.com / fonts.gstatic.com). This sends your IP address to Google but sets no cookies.</p>
<h3>Your control</h3>
<p>Any browser lets you block or delete cookies; blocking strictly necessary ones may prevent the site from loading.</p>
